# Sprint 2 Review

## Objective

To implement the transactional functionality of the Leaf & Root e-commerce system by enabling basket management, guest checkout and order processing.

## Completed Features

- Basket Management
  - Basket Model
  - Basket Item Model
  - Add Products to Basket
  - Update Quantities
  - Remove Products
  - Basket Total Calculation

- Product Pricing
  - Product Price Storage
  - Product Price Display
  - Product Price Validation

- Checkout
  - Checkout Form
  - Customer Details Capture
  - Checkout Validation
  - Guest Checkout Workflow

- Orders
  - Order Model
  - Order Item Model
  - Orders Database Table
  - Order Items Database Table
  - Order Creation
  - Order Confirmation Page
  - Basket Clearing After Checkout

## Outcome

Customers can select products, manage basket contents, proceed through checkout, submit delivery information, place orders and receive a confirmation page. Order information and order items are stored successfully within the database, creating a complete end-to-end purchasing workflow.

## Sprint Result

Successful